<h1>9. Recommendations</h1>

<h3>9.1 Domain-Specific Technical Recommendations</h3>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Security Headers:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Implement a restrictive <code>Content-Security-Policy</code> starting in report-only mode before transitioning to enforcement.</li>
      <li>Enforce <code>Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload</code> across all HTTPS endpoints.</li>
      <li>Add <code>X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff</code> to all responses.</li>
      <li>Configure <code>Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin</code> to prevent token leakage.</li>
      <li>Deploy <code>Permissions-Policy</code> disabling unused APIs: <code>geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=()</code>.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Cookies and Browser Security:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Enforce <code>HttpOnly</code>, <code>Secure</code>, and <code>SameSite=Lax</code> (or <code>Strict</code>) on all session-related cookies.</li>
      <li>Never store authentication tokens (JWTs) or sensitive customer PII in browser <code>localStorage</code> or <code>sessionStorage</code>.</li>
      <li>Scope cookies tightly to the exact origin by omitting loose wildcard domains.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><strong>SSL/TLS Infrastructure:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Disable TLS 1.0 and TLS 1.1 across all load balancers, proxies, and web servers.</li>
      <li>Permit only modern AEAD ciphers with Ephemeral Diffie-Hellman (PFS).</li>
      <li>Ensure automated 90-day certificate rotation pipelines (e.g. Let's Encrypt / ACME) with monitoring.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Performance & Core Web Vitals:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Convert image media to AVIF/WebP formats with explicit width and height dimensions to eliminate layout shifts (CLS &le; 0.1).</li>
      <li>Implement code-splitting and defer non-critical JavaScript to reduce Total Blocking Time (TBT &le; 200ms).</li>
      <li>Utilize edge CDN caching for static assets with long <code>Cache-Control</code> max-age headers.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Accessibility (a11y):</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Ensure all interactive elements have accessible names (ARIA attributes and <code>aria-label</code> tags).</li>
      <li>Maintain color contrast ratios of at least 4.5:1 for standard text (WCAG 2.1 AA compliance).</li>
      <li>Verify seamless keyboard navigation and visual focus rings across all forms and navigation bars.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Web Best Practices:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Audit npm dependencies regularly using automated dependency scanners (e.g., <code>pnpm audit</code> or Snyk).</li>
      <li>Enforce Subresource Integrity (SRI) hashes on all external third-party script tags.</li>
      <li>Eliminate deprecated web APIs and mixed-content passive resources.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Search Engine Optimization (SEO):</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Ensure every page provides unique <code>&lt;title&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;meta name="description"&gt;</code>, and canonical link tags.</li>
      <li>Maintain an updated <code>sitemap.xml</code> and properly configured <code>robots.txt</code> file.</li>
      <li>Structure content with a logical single-<code>&lt;h1&gt;</code> heading hierarchy.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Technology Stack Hardening:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Suppress server banner headers (<code>Server</code>, <code>X-Powered-By</code>) at the reverse proxy.</li>
      <li>Deploy a Web Application Firewall (WAF) to detect and block malicious automated recon and Layer 7 abuse.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Agentic Browsing & AI-Agent Readiness:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li>Publish an <code>llms.txt</code> file at the site root defining machine-friendly summaries of company capabilities and API documentation.</li>
      <li>Inject structured schema markup (JSON-LD) for Organization, WebSite, and Product/Service entities.</li>
      <li>Ensure predictable semantic DOM tags (<code>&lt;nav&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;main&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;article&gt;</code>) to allow autonomous AI agents to parse page context without layout friction.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ol>

